  "description": "Shared TCP transport layer for DS_Communication: TcpSession, StreamByteChannel and TcpTransportOptions with optional TLS (SslStream, handshake timeout enforced). Transports expose only a byte channel — the application creates and owns sessions, and disconnection surfaces solely as Session.Disconnected(DisconnectReason). Targets .NET Standard 2.1 — runs on modern .NET and Unity.",
